Package: TMDLDash
Title: Expert Query TMDL Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Hillary", "Marler", , "Marler.Hillary@epa.gov", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The Expert Query TMDL Dashboard is an R Shiny application
    designed to summarize and count TMDLs based on user-selected filters
    (state, region, pollutant, year, addressed parameter). TMDL data from
    ATTAINS are downloaded via Expert Query web services and are refreshed
    weekly.
